<title>UK: Reuters down on press report.</title>
<headline>Reuters down on press report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Reuters Holdings Plc dropped 14p to 686 in early trade on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers attributed the fall to a Financial Times report which said a brokerage is to publish a report on a decline in forex activity and its repercussions.</p>
<p>A Reuters spokesman declined to comment, saying it was too close to the scheduled release of the company's annual results, due on February 11.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
